          "tag": "owl_property",
          "value": "object",
          "@type": "Annotation"
        },
        {
          "tag": "owl_domain",
          "value": "d3f:Plan",
          "@type": "Annotation"
        }
      ],
      "description": "x prescribes y: x provides a directive specification for y (i.e., x serves as a rule or guide for how y is intended to occur or be made).",
      "title": "prescribes",
      "comments": [
        "D3FEND declares the domain d3f:Plan, which no one kind here holds whole, so every kind may hold this slot.",
        "Modeling intent: use to connect plans (like techniques) to the events that would occur when the plan is carried out. This relation does not, by itself, assert that any particular event occurred; only that the plan includes or directs that kind of event. May also be used for design/blueprint-like specifications of artifacts."
      ],
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/d3fend/d3fend_entries",
      "see_also": [
        "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001942"
      ],
